  "2026-10-20T00:38:23.517Z",codex-agent,"Fresh no-local clone of implementation f7e81d3c2224264bb7901ac39d545b59b30c329c passes the repo-pinned pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers --json after normal npm ci with isolated HOME and disabled global/system Git configuration: all ten checks are healthy, no history drift or pending merge receipts; only the existing stale-in-progress advisory remains. The earlier unchanged-runtime-policy phrase refers to PM test-result and lifecycle settings; the release thread-resolution policy was deliberately narrowed to three trusted Bot logins. Thread mapping: PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M6uJqjR derives caller identity; PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M6uJqjW restricts both selectors; PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M6uJqje requires verified provenance in the guide gate; PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M6uJqji is refused as a dead-flag restoration, with stale guide text removed and accepted removal 3bdbeed preserved. No review replies, resolutions or bot mentions were sent. Releasing the claim while leaving the item in progress for orchestrator verification; CI will be read back after pushing. Remaining limits: two existing opt-in fleet skips and no live trusted publication or consumer migration acceptance."
