  "2026-10-20T01:24:56.133Z",codex-agent,"Implementation commit f4f51a3ad414d3c6f51c15b62f97a8d8d11b0d6e includes the fix, executable regression and append-only tracker evidence. Required npm run release:check passes with isolated HOME and GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null plus GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1: 1372 tests, 1370 passed, 0 failed/cancelled/TODO, 2 existing opt-in real-data fleet skips. Coverage: all 30 measured source files at 100% statements/branches/functions/lines with unchanged per-file thresholds. Duplication: 0/28131 lines, 83 sources, 0 clone pairs; docstrings: 255 declarations across 30 files; production audit: 0 vulnerabilities; package dry-run: 77 files; changelog/date, attestation and lifecycle gates all pass. Fresh git clone --no-local of f4f51a3 passes repo-pinned pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers --json after normal npm ci under isolated Git identity; only the existing stale_in_progress_items:10 advisory remains. The original working checkout's local extension skew and merge-fence drift are absent in the fresh clone. Bun release gate is now running."
  "2026-10-20T01:29:47.566Z",codex-agent,"Final review-round gates: npm run release:check AND bun run release:check both exit 0 under isolated HOME with GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1. Each has 1372 tests: 1370 passed, 0 failed/cancelled/TODO, 2 pre-existing opt-in real-data fleet skips; all 30 measured source files reach 100% statements/branches/functions/lines at unchanged thresholds. Both report duplication 0/28131 lines across 83 sources, 0 clone pairs; docstrings 255 declarations; 0 production audit vulnerabilities; 77 packed files; changelog/date, canonical publish-attestation and lifecycle checks pass. New workflow tests and PM-linked acceptance pass 11/11; both independent behavioral reverts fail 0/1 and restore passes 1/0. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M6uKap3 is fixed by f4f51a3; latest review has no outside-diff findings; broader review found no additional valid install-pin issue. Remaining limits: two existing opt-in fleet skips, stale-item advisory, and live trusted publication/consumer migration outside this review round. No new PM CLI/SDK defect found. Existing linked-test persistence policy remains disabled; results are recorded here. No review replies or resolutions, bot mentions, merge, release or deployment performed. Releasing the claim for orchestrator verification; item remains in progress."
