  "2026-10-20T02:50:19.311Z",codex-agent,"Fixed PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M6uLH2Y: Pack verified release now receives BUN_VERIFY from inputs.npm-publish && inputs.bun-verify, initializes cli_version empty, and performs caller/fallback lookup plus exact-version validation only on the enabled path. Tests execute real git/npm pack fixtures across root/nested projects: 14 enabled pin cases retain exact/revision success and invalid-range rejection; 9 disabled cases cover all three false input combinations with caller ranges, fallback ranges and absent fallback metadata, requiring tarball/bundle/checksum and empty cli_version. Revert proof: with the final regression unchanged, temporarily replaced only .github/workflows/daily-release.yml with its f6b31c2 version; node --test --test-name-pattern=\"pack validates CLI pins only\" test/daily-release-workflow.test.ts exited 1 (0 pass, 1 fail), rejecting the disabled ranged-pin fixture with the exact-pin diagnostic. Restored the fix; node --test test/daily-release-workflow.test.ts and pm test ops-reusable-daily-release --run --match \"node --test test/daily-release-workflow.test.ts\" --progress passed 11/11 each, zero failures/skips/cancelled/todo. Self-review checked the full PR diff and related pin/input consumers; no additional instance found. Typecheck passed. Local health has inherited ambient extension version skew and npm-ci-generated merge fence drift; fresh isolated-home clone health will distinguish checkout evidence without changing pinned dependencies or existing history."
  "2026-10-20T03:06:52.133Z",codex-agent,"Final-table source-only revert proof repeated after correcting a TypeScript fixture inference issue: node --test --test-name-pattern=\"pack validates CLI pins only\" test/daily-release-workflow.test.ts exits 1 with 0 passed and 1 failed when only the workflow is reverted to f6b31c2; the exact-pin error rejects the disabled ranged-pin fixture. Restored the workflow immediately. Required env HOME=$(mktemp -d) GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check exits 0: 1372 tests, 1370 passed, 0 failed/cancelled/TODO, 2 existing opt-in fleet skips; all 30 measured source files have 100% statements/branches/functions/lines at unchanged per-file thresholds. Duplication 0/28146 lines, 83 sources, 0 clone pairs; docstrings 255 declarations; production audit 0 vulnerabilities; package dry-run 77 files. Changelog/date, publish-attestation and lifecycle gates all pass. The initial test compilation failure was limited to inferred fixture-array concat types and corrected with array spreads; the complete gate was rerun. Preparing the implementation commit with tracker evidence, then running the required Bun gate and fresh no-local clone health."
