  "2026-10-20T04:49:27.029Z",claude-orchestrator,"CodeRabbit Minor PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M6uM2HZ (daily-release.ts:97): stampExtensionVersion matched any depth-1 'version' token followed by ':' and a string, so a top-level ternary 'channel: isDev ? version : \"stable\"' (also parenthesized) would have been stamped. Now a key must directly follow the descriptor '{' or a ',' outside parentheses/brackets. Regression 'extension stamping ignores a version token outside a property-key position'; behavioural revert proof: with only the key-position check removed the test fails 0/1, restored passes 1/1. Gates: npm and bun release:check 1371/1373 (2 existing opt-in skips), 100/100/100/100 coverage on 30 sources."
